		NPCs: {
			ZombieDevilMinion.DisplayName: Zombie Devil Minion
			DevilBat.DisplayName: Devil Bat
			ZombieDevil.DisplayName: Zombie Devil
			BatDevil.DisplayName: Bat Devil
			GhostDevil.DisplayName: Ghost Devil
			SpiderDevil.DisplayName: Spider Devil
			FireDevil.DisplayName: Fire Devil
			GunDevilSpawn.DisplayName: Gun Devil Spawn
			EternityFleshling.DisplayName: Eternity Fleshling
			EternityDevil.DisplayName: Eternity Devil
			GunDevil.DisplayName: Gun Devil
			Makima.DisplayName: Makima
		}

		Bestiary: {
			ZombieDevilMinion: A human who made a contract with the Zombie Devil, now nothing more than its puppet.
			DevilBat: A small devil that hunts in swarms at night. The Bat Devil calls them to its side.
			ZombieDevil: A hulking devil that commands an army of the dead. Its leaps shake the ground and spray blood everywhere.
			BatDevil: A giant devil that drinks blood to grow stronger. It rains blood from the sky and dives at its prey.
			GhostDevil: A pale devil that drifts through solid rock. Easy to miss in the dark until it is right behind you.
			SpiderDevil: A many-legged devil that skitters through caves. Its bite is venomous.
			FireDevil: A devil born from the fear of fire. It lives among the flames of the Underworld.
			GunDevilSpawn: A floating chunk of the Gun Devil's flesh, still bristling with barrels.
			EternityFleshling: A lump of the Eternity Devil. As long as these live, their master keeps healing.
			EternityDevil: A vast mass of flesh that traps its prey forever. Kill its Fleshlings, or it will never stop regenerating.
			GunDevil: One of the most feared devils. It fills the air with bullets and charges without mercy.
			Makima: A calm woman who treats devils like dogs on a leash. While her contracted devils live, the damage she takes is shared with them.
		}

		Projectiles: {
			ChainsawArmProjectile.DisplayName: Chainsaw Arm
			PochitaPetProjectile.DisplayName: Pochita
			BloodBolt.DisplayName: Blood Bolt
			FireBolt.DisplayName: Fire Bolt
